1
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,740
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(I'm still the most favored one!)

4
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,560
My daughter...

5
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:29,520
Lingxi.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,640
Lingxi!

7
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,160
What's wrong, Consort Rong?

8
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,760
I dreamed of Lingxi.

9
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,480
I understand.

10
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,160
Lingxi met an unjust death.

11
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,920
As her mother,

12
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,440
you must suffer every day.

13
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,520
I feel so guilty.

14
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,440
I failed to protect the princess.

15
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,800
She called out to me in my dream,

16
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:01,600
saying she's suffering down there,

17
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,240
and she's so scared.

18
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,800
I told her

19
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,720
to move on and be reborn soon,

20
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,520
but she won't go.

21
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,440
It tears my heart to pieces.

22
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,440
Tomorrow I'll issue a decree

23
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,360
to grant Lingxi a posthumous title.

24
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,760
And bury her

25
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,360
with full princess honors.

26
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,800
I'll also have the monks
of Guangji Temple

27
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:31,400
perform rites for her soul.

28
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,600
I believe Lingxi will escape
her suffering

29
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,720
and find peace.

30
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,000
On Lingxi's behalf,

31
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,560
thank you, Your Majesty.

32
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,800
(A title?)

33
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,760
(A posthumous honor?)

34
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,520
(Lingxi is already dead.)

35
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,960
(What good are those empty honors?)

36
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,640
(All I want)

37
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,080
(is to use His Majesty's hand)

38
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,440
(to perform a ritual)

39
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,480
(and make the demon hiding in the dark)

40
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,760
(show its true face.)

41
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:24,900
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

42
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,080
Amitabha.

43
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,200
The princess died young.

44
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,640
Her soul is restless.

45
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:37,080
We must choose those whose
Bazi match hers

46
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,880
to keep vigil for her one night
after the rite,

47
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,360
chanting sutras for her.

48
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,920
Only then can her soul rest

49
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,440
and reach the pure land.

50
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,600
Do as he says.

51
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,560
Yes, Your Majesty.

52
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,640
Keeping vigil in this hall
in the dead of night?

53
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,320
So scary.

54
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,320
Who knows

55
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:56,320
how much resentment that child holds?

56
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,920
We're only praying for the child.

57
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,200
A clear conscience

58
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:01,080
fears nothing.

59
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:03,000
Don't overthink it.

60
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,400
Cairen Kang,

61
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,560
Zhaoyi Xin,

62
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,040
and Concubine Rou.

63
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,360
Their Bazi

64
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,720
match the princess's.

65
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,920
I've never experienced
anything like this.

66
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,720
If something goes wrong,

67
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,880
I fear it might keep her from peace.

68
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,640
I'm timid.

69
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,680
What am I to do?

70
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:36,560
Concubine Rou,

71
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,680
Cairen Kang.

72
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,960
You've always been close to
Consort Rong,

73
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,160
like sisters.

74
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,920
It's fate that brought you together.

75
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,080
If you help Princess Lingxi sincerely,

76
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,520
Consort Rong will be grateful.

77
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,040
Yes.

78
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,560
Your Highness.

79
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:11,460
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

80
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:21,760
Concubine Rou.

81
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,720
Since I entered the palace,

82
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,720
you've been favored by His Majesty.

83
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:29,480
I was just a lowly Cairen then.

84
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,800
But I always followed the rules.

85
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,880
I never thought we had any ill will.

86
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,640
Back then,

87
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,600
you never fought for favor,

88
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,960
always kept your head down.

89
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,880
There's no grudge between us.

90
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:47,040
I thought we'd brought down
Noble Consort Hui

91
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,440
and risked our lives together,

92
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:51,600
we could trust each other.

93
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,680
I thought in this harem,

94
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:57,240
we could be sincere with each other.

95
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,320
I haven't forgotten

96
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,520
that you saved my life.

97
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:14,480
You seem frightened tonight.

98
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,760
It's only one night's vigil.

99
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,480
(Spirit Tablet of Princess)
Why are you so uneasy?

100
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,840
Not at all.

101
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,200
It's just a bit windy tonight.

102
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,000
I'm feeling a little cold.

103
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,000
Concubine Rou.

104
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,320
Come burn some joss paper for Lingxi.

105
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:39,100
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

106
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:57,100
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

107
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:08,760
A ghost...

108
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,440
A ghost!

109
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:10,360
It's haunted!

110
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,600
Sinful soul!

111
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:18,900
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

112
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:25,800
Stop your tricks!

113
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,880
You think I'll be scared?

114
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,880
In this harem,

115
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,680
I've seen plenty of ghosts and spirits.

116
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:32,320
What are you really after?

117
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:36,800
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

118
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,600
Consort Rong.

119
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,080
You suspect me, don't you?

120
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:42,280
Trying to scare me with
such cheap tricks?

121
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,800
Who would've thought

122
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,320
the great Consort Rong

123
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,240
would stoop to such petty means.

124
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,280
Mother...

125
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,080
Mother.

126
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,240
It's so cold down here...

127
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,120
Mother.

128
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,400
(Concubine Rou.)

129
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,840
(I bet you never forgot)

130
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:14,520
(the baby you miscarried
before three months.)

131
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,600
I was less than three months
in your womb.

132
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,520
Don't you remember me, mother?

133
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:25,000
You even prepared for me

134
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,360
a hundred-blessing bib

135
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,880
and tiger-head shoes.

136
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,400
Don't you remember that, mother?

137
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,200
(What's going on?)

138
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,160
Mother...

139
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,560
She's torturing me.

140
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,920
I can't be reborn.

141
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,200
Save me, mother!

142
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,960
Save me!

143
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,400
Mother...

144
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,560
Concubine Rou.

145
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:58,000
Your child has come to
collect what's owed.

146
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,280
Unless you atone for your sins,

147
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:02,840
your child

148
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,680
will suffer endlessly,

149
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,640
never to be reborn.

150
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,680
Punish me instead.

151
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,880
Don't torment my child.

152
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,240
Please...

153
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,880
Spare my child.

154
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,360
You hurt someone else's child.

155
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:29,280
Why should they spare yours?

156
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,040
Whether they can

157
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:32,920
find peace in the afterlife,

158
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:36,280
and whether Lingxi can forgive you,

159
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,280
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

160
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,120
all depends on you.

161
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,000
Consort Rong.

162
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,160
How cruel of you!

163
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,720
You know how much I cherish the child

164
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,880
who died so young.

165
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,840
I've never forgotten.

166
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,520
And you used that

167
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,720
to cut me to the heart.

168
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,480
You're wrong.

169
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,800
I know neither of us fears ghosts.

170
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,480
What keeps mothers like us
awake at night

171
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,200
is our children.

172
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,960
A clear conscience

173
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,880
fears no ghost at the door.

174
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,120
Answer me.

175
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,720
We have no feud.

176
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:25,480
Why did you poison my infant daughter
and rob her voice?

177
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,220
(Spirit Tablet of
Princess Lingxi Jinghe)

178
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:32,840
Because I hated you.

179
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,480
Fu Rong.

180
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,240
I was born beautiful,

181
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,920
and Consort Qi supported me.

182
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:48,600
I'd carefully planned a chance encounter
in the imperial garden.

183
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,280
On such a cold night,

184
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:52,640
I danced in the garden all night

185
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,920
and finally His Majesty came.

186
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:58,280
But then your child was born.

187
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:00,720
When he heard she had jaundice,

188
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,120
he cast me aside

189
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,440
making me the laughingstock
of the entire harem.

190
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,720
How was that fair?

191
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,600
Of course I hated you!

192
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,080
So...

193
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,920
I got some goldthread​.

194
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,320
soaked it in ginger juice,

195
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:21,480
turning the jaundice remedy

196
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,560
into poison.

197
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:32,560
You gave Consort Qi a folk remedy
for her headaches,

198
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,400
then arranged for her to obtain

199
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,600
ginger-prepared goldthread​
from the Imperial Hospital.

200
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:39,040
You framed her.

201
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,560
You also bribed

202
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,400
Dongmei, the maid
who brewed Lingxi's medicine,

203
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,120
to use this goldthread every day

204
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,760
and feed it to my Lingxi.

205
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:52,120
That's how my daughter lost her voice.

206
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,520
Am I right?

207
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,720
I thought

208
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,080
I'd covered every trace.

209
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,520
But I never expected

210
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:07,000
you'd uncover the truth.

211
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:10,720
I thought killing Dongmei to silence her

212
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,040
left you no witness or evidence.

213
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,440
But somehow,

214
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:18,640
you used this cruel trick
to force a confession.

215
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:21,560
That's right.

216
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,440
That's exactly

217
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:28,880
how I silenced your Lingxi.

218
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,000
You're truly

219
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,240
out of your mind!

220
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,760
How naive you are.

221
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,680
You actually believed

222
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,720
that anyone in this harem

223
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,560
could be sincere with you

224
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,560
and trust you?

225
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,040
Ridiculous!

226
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,600
In this harem,

227
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,000
whoever wins His Majesty's favor

228
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,600
can rise high.

229
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,800
Whoever he won't glance at

230
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,760
is trampled by everyone.

231
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,680
As long as we're here,

232
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:16,200
we're born to be rivals.

233
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,760
I promised my daughter.

234
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:28,920
Those who hurt her

235
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,600
will not get away.

236
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,200
Just you wait.

237
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,920
I will make you

238
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,200
pay for what you've done.

239
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,000
Consort Rong.

240
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:55,040
You think bringing down
Noble Consort Hui

241
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:56,880
means I fear you?

242
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,440
His Majesty only pities you.

243
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,920
My beauty

244
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,560
is what he loves most.

245
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,520
My pretty face

246
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:09,200
is enough to let me
reign supreme over the harem!

247
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,040
In the end,

248
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,640
I'm still the most favored one!

249
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:31,140
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

250
00:13:31,460 --> 00:13:36,180
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

251
00:13:36,300 --> 00:13:40,980
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

252
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:45,820
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

253
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:50,580
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

254
00:13:50,980 --> 00:13:55,620
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

255
00:13:55,780 --> 00:14:00,420
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

256
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:05,380
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

257
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:10,140
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

258
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:13,540
♪Let the stars and sea♪

259
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:15,540
(Changsheng Gate)

260
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:18,860
♪Wait for your return♪
